{"screen_name": "r_i_m_000", "file": "r_i_m_000", "name": "れいみ", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1685206993001435136/IN052Vkf.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1447274355801559046/1725827126/1500x500", "description": "好きにやる", "total_works": 40, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2025-10-05T15:35:43.943674+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-02-16T08:17:08.242401+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-05T23:35:43.943674"}, {"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-06T11:55:00.254010"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 5000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 5000, "max": 5000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/r_i_m_000", "name": "r_i_m_000"}], "flags": {"from_archive": true}, "works": [{"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/139df7ef/uploads/origins/9db882c0-cb0a-4b43-9ccf-4508912101e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9b6aca3bac562ac3708811c89a21ada", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/139df7ef/uploads/origins/9db882c0-cb0a-4b43-9ccf-4508912101e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9b6aca3bac562ac3708811c89a21ada, https://si.imgix.net/139df7ef/uploads/origins/9db882c0-cb0a-4b43-9ccf-4508912101e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4bde6096e64cf3149bd9e4b071f3b15b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/139df7ef/uploads/origins/9db882c0-cb0a-4b43-9ccf-4508912101e4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db4a1f1e185fe2154a8965cd943cab1b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, your art is so cute!! I would like to request art of my VTuber: https://www.deviantart.com/stash/22517uwjlwwa\n\nShe is a serious magical girl and does not smile! Please give her a cat tail. \nThe pose and composition is up to you!\n\nI would like to use this art on my twitter and twitch. Thank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/22517uwjlwwa", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/efd6a784/uploads/origins/429df5be-ebb7-41cf-9d82-d3706c002a84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99118f0184445f8b59fc7ba74c3fed07", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/efd6a784/uploads/origins/429df5be-ebb7-41cf-9d82-d3706c002a84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99118f0184445f8b59fc7ba74c3fed07, https://si.imgix.net/efd6a784/uploads/origins/429df5be-ebb7-41cf-9d82-d3706c002a84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f7ec36d347da4223628fb0b0a2f82e6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/efd6a784/uploads/origins/429df5be-ebb7-41cf-9d82-d3706c002a84?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5abb80ac7eb6d578e7d19d56eed26dee 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I love your art style!! I really like the coloring. \n\nI would like to request an illustration of my favorite VTuber, Essie.\nShe is a sleepy sheep girl with a stuffed sheep stuffed toy.\n\nPlease be as creative as you would like!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/u9Xw9R9\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/u9Xw9R9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/38", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e5441a75/uploads/origins/465ff72c-c526-477d-83d8-663453a682ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9688699fe90fc41145c29145613df3f6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e5441a75/uploads/origins/465ff72c-c526-477d-83d8-663453a682ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9688699fe90fc41145c29145613df3f6, https://si.imgix.net/e5441a75/uploads/origins/465ff72c-c526-477d-83d8-663453a682ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=446e69def7bbe398ecc48b8d89c6fe89 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e5441a75/uploads/origins/465ff72c-c526-477d-83d8-663453a682ee?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=581decae19b6085512c2cebf13ed6b8d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi れいみ様, I’d like to request my character. She’s a lonely girl with an appearance of a kid. She is a weak, frail and innocent kid but also strange and gloomy. I would like to have her drawn or interpreted by you based on the song https://youtu.be/v5BloiCJCys?si=WuQ9rrepzO5fk8_m (ヘブンズバグ - いよわ) if that’s possible! If it’s not , I would love for you to just draw her as you like. Thank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nElvzSdBGPZNK9ZDLwpIBGuWPs2lipma", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/37", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f0f84687/uploads/origins/27519cea-3cd6-4610-acd8-5c0dd0681e9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=deb74b5625334295d75793f8e4bd6710", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f0f84687/uploads/origins/27519cea-3cd6-4610-acd8-5c0dd0681e9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=deb74b5625334295d75793f8e4bd6710, https://si.imgix.net/f0f84687/uploads/origins/27519cea-3cd6-4610-acd8-5c0dd0681e9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ab1c781b78a89c5eafeedd7bec92b9a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f0f84687/uploads/origins/27519cea-3cd6-4610-acd8-5c0dd0681e9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01e1a172c4ae8fc417f677486caebf41 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Dear Reimi, Nice to meet you!\nMay I request my Vtuber character if possible?\n\nThe character is based on Sea bunny (Sessile Sea Slug).\nThe character is an underwater nudibranch empress, and her hobby is collecting bones.\nAnd she likes TRPGs, burgers, retro games, stealing bones, napping, and nudibranchs.\nPlease feel free to pose me in any way you like.\nIf you like, you are free to choose other costumes as well.\n\nI want to use them for Twitch and social networking and stuff! m(_ _)m\n\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1e8NxVySA0DhhyPtpWcDCAvkLxutDDD3X", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/36", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed71ba38/uploads/origins/16f36310-160d-4d7e-a4f8-c7a0e5d18cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e07dd0c9ef5ecb58aaaec9ad9faed5c7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ed71ba38/uploads/origins/16f36310-160d-4d7e-a4f8-c7a0e5d18cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e07dd0c9ef5ecb58aaaec9ad9faed5c7, https://si.imgix.net/ed71ba38/uploads/origins/16f36310-160d-4d7e-a4f8-c7a0e5d18cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bed6ca913714e5641ffd90fdf3cf65e4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ed71ba38/uploads/origins/16f36310-160d-4d7e-a4f8-c7a0e5d18cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02995a3c3dfc92f5edac74abb9e2e8d1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, it's nice to meet you! Your art is really cute!!💕  \n\nMay I request my VTuber NUE, would you please draw him in this outfit? https://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/73317864_IWFbpqAEVYpPKzd.png \nThis child is X-gender.  \n\nPlease draw freely! \n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/8052709.nue/gallery", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5b3c8c76/uploads/origins/46e0b274-448c-4102-aacc-2c7fcf4de1c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64a0ad6f785ddcaaca6623b59c34546a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5b3c8c76/uploads/origins/46e0b274-448c-4102-aacc-2c7fcf4de1c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64a0ad6f785ddcaaca6623b59c34546a, https://si.imgix.net/5b3c8c76/uploads/origins/46e0b274-448c-4102-aacc-2c7fcf4de1c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9f7469a88cbab7f9546aefd80abfb25 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5b3c8c76/uploads/origins/46e0b274-448c-4102-aacc-2c7fcf4de1c4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e7d20ed36431e05f025fd91fc2bf3b90 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I truly love your art and think your style is beautiful!! I really like how you draw faces.\n\nI would like to request an illustration of my character. She is a strange and soft angel who likes fabric and birds.\n\nI'd be very happy if you drew her in any way that you'd like.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-IT_pIFedkTofEz9-VYnF-ykfjSNQA7b?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-IT_pIFedkTofEz9-VYnF-ykfjSNQA7b?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2e393fdf/uploads/origins/53fb7c0d-8024-490f-b326-6d39a213a12a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eec92cf03c637f353b599f5e265966b0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2e393fdf/uploads/origins/53fb7c0d-8024-490f-b326-6d39a213a12a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eec92cf03c637f353b599f5e265966b0, https://si.imgix.net/2e393fdf/uploads/origins/53fb7c0d-8024-490f-b326-6d39a213a12a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7deadb713e1c2c852b2b76a41774b13d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2e393fdf/uploads/origins/53fb7c0d-8024-490f-b326-6d39a213a12a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce24fb498bb4d4b4da9c2df9bfe60bac 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "It is nice to meet you! I fell in love at first sight with the illustrations that Reimi-sensei draws, and I would like to contact you in the hope that I can commission you for this project. The minimum width is 640 pixels and the aspect ratio is 16:9. [Illustration details] I would like to request a thumbnail of the song \"Haruganakainai Machi\" by Walking Man. https://youtu.be/Gp3tQIVPFjY?si =-The background and facial expressions can be left up to you! We are looking for a character who is dressed in uniform! Character data: https://lit.link/rorurou", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ac133e1/uploads/origins/b8d47a1f-b1b5-42f3-a549-58220205f4be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=131997d25ccd8067d6816c283816ad93", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ac133e1/uploads/origins/b8d47a1f-b1b5-42f3-a549-58220205f4be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=131997d25ccd8067d6816c283816ad93, https://si.imgix.net/6ac133e1/uploads/origins/b8d47a1f-b1b5-42f3-a549-58220205f4be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9c9fb319ed546c86c4932b405903a12 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6ac133e1/uploads/origins/b8d47a1f-b1b5-42f3-a549-58220205f4be?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=896d21410a4074eb3f73582393ece118 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "れいみ様、初めまして。\nもしご都合がよろしければ、私のVtuberキャラを描いていただけると嬉しいです。\n\n● キャラクターの参考情報\n寄宿学校に通う温和でおっとりした文学女子です。お嬢様の割にはかなりオタクです。好きな物はレトロゲーム、お絵描き、美術館巡りです。\n\n● 利用用途\n・配信用のサムネイルでの使用\n・SNSでの掲載、またはアイコン・ヘッダーとしての使用\n\nイラストの内容などは、参考情報をもとにれいみ様におまかせしたいと思います。\n\nお忙しいところ恐れ入りますが、ご検討いただけますと幸いです。\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10SsUbOpLjIeAn5QvrMR--yWfGEi661h7", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d24b2eb/uploads/origins/ea6697a4-0fd9-4f19-a968-53801d63c674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0208417a41eb33619cf23edf83f5518", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4d24b2eb/uploads/origins/ea6697a4-0fd9-4f19-a968-53801d63c674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0208417a41eb33619cf23edf83f5518, https://si.imgix.net/4d24b2eb/uploads/origins/ea6697a4-0fd9-4f19-a968-53801d63c674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ae721d24f236caac56be15d3ef2d6b7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4d24b2eb/uploads/origins/ea6697a4-0fd9-4f19-a968-53801d63c674?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8475a297c7720e222bdb372f0da1a186 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつも見ています。もうすぐ大好きな人の誕生日なので是非描いてもらいたいと思いました。描いてもらうことは了承済みです。その人は私の光で希望で愛です。元々〝ヒヨルナ〟というアイドルグループで活動していて、今はハンドメイドやイベントに細々と活動してます。そのこのイメージは、淡いピンク、白、真実、愛、リボン、フリル。といった感じです。\nどんなイラストお願いしようか迷ったのですが、あなたの感性が好きなので、あなたが感じたまま描いてほしいです。\n\nそのこは、cumurixx(くむり)、という名前です。\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/91c1d333/uploads/origins/efa23836-71ec-4580-a4d9-e416aa2bc5a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06cd7cc5d2d639cc20576f2f1410bbd0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/91c1d333/uploads/origins/efa23836-71ec-4580-a4d9-e416aa2bc5a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06cd7cc5d2d639cc20576f2f1410bbd0, https://si.imgix.net/91c1d333/uploads/origins/efa23836-71ec-4580-a4d9-e416aa2bc5a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=896b3f8a855aebbbf7783c9ebd320115 2x, https://si.imgix.net/91c1d333/uploads/origins/efa23836-71ec-4580-a4d9-e416aa2bc5a1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b393b369d098df66da77e2f5d2d613b1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Good evening,\nI've seen your art and fell in love with it. \nI hope you will accept to draw my bear VTuber Freya. \n\nShe is a guild receptionist who is very big sister-like.\nThe composition is completely up to you.\n\nHere are my references:\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nhsTfuI4bjvgZ1p3I3XGgX3LNVSViEDr?usp=drive_link\n\n\nI want to use the artwork for Vtuber activies & SNS.\nThank you", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/30", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/40361f77/uploads/origins/77320e30-331e-4d38-a2c0-e1e6ee93e5f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50e4c5c8a7f285b5f740648b829f72ce", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/40361f77/uploads/origins/77320e30-331e-4d38-a2c0-e1e6ee93e5f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50e4c5c8a7f285b5f740648b829f72ce, https://si.imgix.net/40361f77/uploads/origins/77320e30-331e-4d38-a2c0-e1e6ee93e5f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b73aac29e7a7550579fbaae143920e8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/40361f77/uploads/origins/77320e30-331e-4d38-a2c0-e1e6ee93e5f4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2501fc8c8409b4a35a2d76cb19d1a1f6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really loved your last illustration of my character!\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/requests/1549521\n\nPlease draw my Vtuber digi_shell. She is a tamagotchi princess. \nShe is a melancholic girl that has a mysterious, quiet personality with a sad smile.\nI like these two pieces you drew the most:\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@r_i_m_000/works/9\nhttps://skeb.jp/@r_i_m_000/works/6\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/15YSuHvTX5mF50Q9mqkFxzrHygSySfsuc", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@r_i_m_000/works/29", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/350f7d33/uploads/origins/43a3bc51-430c-4e48-ae20-1b7be52464ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7db390c1bb3421bbb1a10e2fc00476d9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/350f7d33/uploads/origins/43a3bc51-430c-4e48-ae20-1b7be52464